E AX3030 482-evidence-word-capacity.ax:7:5-9 evidence-word-capacity "this signature declares 65 type variables, and the evidence word carries 64" #"too many type variables for one word" !"a symbolic witness reads its bit with a shift by the variable's index, and a shift of 64 or more is poison in the emitted LLVM - an arbitrary answer at run time, which under reference maps is a wrong free; the widest signature in this repository declares 4" ?"split the declaration, or make some positions concrete - each variable needs one bit"
